ge wants the right to appear and be heard in the bankruptcy case.","Kaiser Gypsum wants to limit participation to those with direct legal interests in the estate."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 26, lines 43-47","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-1079_4357.pdf","page_label":"file page 26, lines 43-47"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 41, lines 43-31","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-1079_4357.pdf","page_label":"file page 41, lines 43-31"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 23-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-1079_4357.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 23-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 64, lines 21-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-1079_4357.pdf","page_label":"file page 64, lines 21-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 69, lines 49-11","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-1079_4357.pdf","page_label":"file page 69, lines 49-11"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 84, lines 25-41","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-1079_4357.pdf","page_label":"file page 84, lines 25-41"}]},{"heading":"What each side says","paragraphs":["Truck argues it is a party in interest because it will pay nearly all asbestos claims.","Kaiser argues a party in interest must have a legal interest in the debtor's property."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 26, lines 43-47"